  "subject": "Clean Host Qualification had never produced a successful run. It required two externally published immutable image references, but the runner rejects any image whose org.opencontainers.image.revision label differs from the source SHA under qualification, and a published image only carries the label of the commit it was built from. Registry authentication was a second, independent failure: runs 35804960457 and 38255657782 both failed with TCR unauthorized because the job never ran docker login. The workflow now builds both images from its own checkout via --build-source-images, which needs no registry and no credential and makes the revision label correct by construction.",
